fine. Gateway in both sides is a linux box running iptables. We're running
ICQ Groupware Server and ICQ Groupware clients for instant messages.

    I need, somehow, block ICQ File transfers, but I cannot block ICQ
messages. ICQ Client does not allow this kind of config. I was thinking on
some string match to block the initial ICQ File transfer request. Question
is: do anybody here has the string I'm looking for ? Has anyone experienced
a similar problem ?

